### 쿠폰 생성 (정액 할인)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/admin/v1/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

{
  "name": "1000원 할인 쿠폰",
  "discountType": "FIXED",
  "discountValue": 1000,
  "minOrderAmount": 5000,
  "maxDiscountAmount": null,
  "totalQuantity": 100,
  "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00+09:00",
  "validUntil": "2026-12-31T23:59:59+09:00"
}

### 쿠폰 생성 (정률 할인)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/admin/v1/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

{
  "name": "10% 할인 쿠폰",
  "discountType": "RATE",
  "discountValue": 10,
  "minOrderAmount": 10000,
  "maxDiscountAmount": 5000,
  "totalQuantity": 50,
  "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00+09:00",
  "validUntil": "2026-12-31T23:59:59+09:00"
}

### 전체 쿠폰 목록 조회 (페이지네이션)
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/admin/v1/coupons?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

### 쿠폰 상세 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/admin/v1/coupons/1
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

### 쿠폰 수정
PUT {{commerce-api}}/api/admin/v1/coupons/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

{
  "name": "2000원 할인 쿠폰",
  "discountType": "FIXED",
  "discountValue": 2000,
  "minOrderAmount": 10000,
  "maxDiscountAmount": null,
  "totalQuantity": 200,
  "validFrom": "2026-01-01T00:00:00+09:00",
  "validUntil": "2026-12-31T23:59:59+09:00"
}

### 쿠폰 삭제
DELETE {{commerce-api}}/api/admin/v1/coupons/1
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

### 쿠폰 발급 내역 조회 (페이지네이션)
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/admin/v1/coupons/1/issued?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin
